WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:13.400
At this point, there is an avatar fan that hasn't heard of the white lotus, but what about

00:13.400 --> 00:14.840
the red lotus?

00:14.840 --> 00:20.040
The red lotus is an anarchist organization in Legend of Korra, founded by Jee Bao, an ex-member

00:20.040 --> 00:24.440
of the white lotus, as I hear explains to Korra that the red lotus was created to do what

00:24.440 --> 00:28.840
the white lotus failed at, having the humans and spirits co-exist and to usher in a new

00:28.840 --> 00:29.840
world order.

00:29.840 --> 00:35.040
You're watching Avatar Discussions, and this is everything we know about the red lotus.

00:35.040 --> 00:38.240
After the order of the white lotus came out of hiding, following the end of the Hundred

00:38.240 --> 00:42.960
Years' War to serve the avatar in the world's nations, Jee Bao was disgusted, deeming

00:42.960 --> 00:47.080
the white lotus is having reduced itself to merely the avatar's bodyguards.

00:47.080 --> 00:50.880
In order to preserve the way how he believed the order should have been, he broke away and

00:50.880 --> 00:54.680
founded the red lotus to help liberate the world from the nation's influence.

00:54.680 --> 00:58.520
Their original plan was to dismantle the nations and their leaders by releasing Vatu

00:58.520 --> 01:02.640
from the Tree of Time, and later by killing the world leaders and ending Korra and the

01:02.640 --> 01:06.400
Avatar Cycle, both of which, as we know, failed.

01:06.400 --> 01:10.440
The only red lotus members who were publicly revealed, as such, were all powerful and

01:10.440 --> 01:12.680
influential people in Korra's world.

01:12.680 --> 01:17.800
The former chief Unilok, the truth-seer I-way, and a group of terrorists led by Zahir,

01:17.800 --> 01:20.640
consisting of Puli, Minghua, and Ghazan.

01:20.640 --> 01:25.280
Zahir and his group had all been imprisoned for 13 years after failing to kidnap five-year-old

01:25.280 --> 01:26.280
Korra.

01:26.280 --> 01:30.560
But following harmonic convergences, Zahir gained the ability to air-bend and was able

01:30.560 --> 01:34.120
to bust himself and the other members of the red lotus out of prison.

01:34.120 --> 01:38.320
The group of four was able to send the earth kingdom into chaos by killing their queen,

01:38.320 --> 01:40.280
but later failed at killing the avatar.

01:40.280 --> 01:43.840
Zahir met Chief Unilok after they had both joined the red lotus.

01:43.840 --> 01:47.760
They learned about Rava and Vatu, the spirits of light and darkness, and how Avatar

01:47.760 --> 01:52.400
one had separated them bringing imbalance to the world, which he, according to the red

01:52.400 --> 01:56.760
lotus, had only strengthened by dividing the physical and spiritual worlds.

01:56.760 --> 02:00.800
The red lotus subsequently devised a plan to kidnap the avatar in order to reverse one's

02:00.800 --> 02:05.200
decision and teach her the ways of the red lotus, so that the avatars going forward

02:05.200 --> 02:07.840
would no longer fight as the avatars from the past.

02:07.840 --> 02:12.560
Zahir, Ghazan, Puli, and Minghua launched their plan to kidnap Korra a year after the

02:12.560 --> 02:16.880
news of her being the new avatar was confirmed, but were unsuccessful due to the intervention

02:16.880 --> 02:20.640
of Tanrak, Tenzin, Chief Saka, and Firelord Zuko.

02:20.640 --> 02:24.160
They were apprehended and detained in four maximum security prisons scattered throughout

02:24.160 --> 02:25.160
the globe.

02:25.160 --> 02:28.840
Unilok, however, avoided being captured by fleeing before the rest were caught, and he

02:28.840 --> 02:32.480
went on to become Chief of the Northern Water Tribe, never suspected of being with the red

02:32.480 --> 02:36.840
lotus, until Zahir tells Korra about the night of her almost kidnapping.

02:36.840 --> 02:40.600
To cover his back, he assisted Firelord Zuko in constructing a prison for Puli in the

02:40.600 --> 02:42.360
coldest part of the North Pole.

02:42.360 --> 02:46.240
As for the others, the order of the white lotus in prison goes on and Minghua in environments

02:46.240 --> 02:50.160
that would suppress their bending while Zahir was held in a remote mountaintop, constructed

02:50.160 --> 02:51.960
entirely out of metal.

02:51.960 --> 02:56.200
The organizations lesser-known agents, such as Aiwei, remained at large, and continued

02:56.200 --> 03:00.080
their operations in secret with the white lotus successfully raising Korra.

03:00.080 --> 03:01.840
The red lotus shifted plans.

03:01.840 --> 03:05.400
Instead of trying to convince the avatar to join them and her adulthood, they decided

03:05.400 --> 03:09.040
to capture and eventually kill her while she was in the avatar state, putting an end

03:09.040 --> 03:12.560
to the reincarnation cycle and further establish anarchy.

03:12.560 --> 03:17.040
Chief Lynn Bayfong of Republic City spent the next 13 years interrogating each member

03:17.040 --> 03:22.000
of the red lotus in order to determine the gang's motives, but she was ultimately unsuccessful.

03:22.000 --> 03:24.560
Following their escape, they planned to take the avatar.

03:24.560 --> 03:28.680
The four made their way to Republic City, where they hid under everybody's noses, planning

03:28.680 --> 03:29.880
their next move.

03:29.880 --> 03:34.240
When the time was right, Zahir shaved his head and infiltrated air temple island under the

03:34.240 --> 03:38.560
disguise of Yeru in an attempt to determine Korra's whereabouts, though as apparent knowledge

03:38.560 --> 03:43.520
of Erinomad culture and desire to meet the avatar, aroused suspicion from Korra, who realized

03:43.520 --> 03:44.880
his true identity.

03:44.880 --> 03:49.040
After a very short battle, Zahir managed to take down Korra and flee the island, using

03:49.040 --> 03:51.560
a glider he had stolen from Tenzin's office.

03:51.560 --> 03:53.360
This caused a widespread hunt for Zahir.

03:53.360 --> 03:57.680
Zahir decided to delay in order to focus on determining a method to leave the city.

03:57.680 --> 04:01.520
To that end, the group ambushed a truck driver, whom Minghua threatened to smuggle them

04:01.520 --> 04:03.520
all out of the city undetected.

04:03.520 --> 04:07.240
The truck driver attempted to drive out of the city via a bridge, though by the time they

04:07.240 --> 04:10.600
got there, the road had already been barricaded, and every vehicle was being searched

04:10.600 --> 04:11.600
by the police.

04:11.600 --> 04:16.240
Anxious over the situation, the driver wavered, while questioned by the officers, who forced

04:16.240 --> 04:18.120
him out of his vehicle as a result.

04:18.120 --> 04:21.720
The truck driver fled the scene and left the police to open the back of the truck, from

04:21.720 --> 04:26.280
where Zahir launched a surprise airbending blast, knocking the officers back and giving Minghua

04:26.280 --> 04:29.920
enough time to gain control of the wheel and begin driving out of the city.

04:29.920 --> 04:34.320
They then hid out and planned their attack on Zahifu to capture Korra.

04:34.320 --> 04:37.680
With the aid of Ai Wei, the red lotus was able to sneak into Zahifu under the cover

04:37.680 --> 04:42.080
of darkness, managing to capture the avatar by knocking her and Naga out with sheer

04:42.080 --> 04:43.440
shoe spit darts.

04:43.440 --> 04:47.880
Their escape did not go unnoticed, however, as Pablo alerted Bolin and Mako, who attacked

04:47.880 --> 04:50.560
the red lotus and drew attention to the group's presence.

04:50.560 --> 04:54.160
The four were soon surrounded by members of the metal clan, who used their metal bending,

04:54.160 --> 04:56.200
to box them in between metal plates.

04:56.200 --> 05:00.640
However, Ghazan used his own skill to free themselves by creating a lava moat, forcing

05:00.640 --> 05:05.560
a stalemate between the two groups, eventually Bolin managed to block police chi, by striking

05:05.560 --> 05:10.040
her third eye with a pebble, while Lin and Sui and Beifong dropped in from above on cables

05:10.040 --> 05:11.400
and rescued Korra.

05:11.400 --> 05:15.720
Zahir attempted to recapture the avatar, but was thwarted by Sui Yin, who pierced the wing

05:15.720 --> 05:19.360
of his glider with metal shards, forcing him to make a crash landing near the rest of

05:19.360 --> 05:24.000
his team, realizing their attempt to kidnap Korra had failed, Zahir created an aerodome

05:24.000 --> 05:26.040
to cover their escape.

05:26.040 --> 05:29.640
After their escape, they began their hunt for the avatar once again, while fighting

05:29.640 --> 05:33.960
with Bolin and Mako, Minghua and Ghazan captured the two, and brought them along on their

05:33.960 --> 05:35.760
way to bossing Sei.

05:35.760 --> 05:39.520
Inside the palace, the four gained an audience with earth-queen hoteing, by baiting her with

05:39.520 --> 05:41.440
information about the stolen airbenders.

05:41.440 --> 05:45.360
Zahir managed to strike a deal with the queen, information about the airbenders and

05:45.360 --> 05:48.640
returned for the avatar, as the avatar's imprisonment in the earth kingdom would lead

05:48.640 --> 05:50.040
to a world war.

05:50.040 --> 05:53.880
The red lotus was escorted to await Korra's arrival, and the earth kingdom royal palace's

05:53.880 --> 05:55.280
anti-chamber.

05:55.280 --> 05:59.200
Using a dioli agent quickly passed by their chamber, Zahir followed him, sneaking into

05:59.200 --> 06:02.880
