06:02.880 --> 06:06.880
in the seawong desert, deciding to take matters into their own hands, the team barged into

06:06.880 --> 06:09.360
the throne room, resulting in a fight with the dioli.

06:09.360 --> 06:12.840
After quickly defeating the earthbenders, Zahir confronted and suffocated the queen with

06:12.840 --> 06:14.640
his airbending, killing her.

06:14.640 --> 06:18.440
As the red lotus leader stated that he had delivered bossing Sei back into the hands of

06:18.440 --> 06:22.880
the people, Ghazan used his lava bending to bring down the wall separating the three rings,

06:22.880 --> 06:25.520
being forth chaos and disorder in the earth kingdom.

06:25.520 --> 06:29.760
Afterwards, Zahir went to the palace's prison, where he released all the inmates.

06:29.760 --> 06:33.960
Before freeing Mako and Bolin, he gave them a message to be delivered to Korra, and promptly

06:33.960 --> 06:36.600
