06:44.360 --> 06:47.640
They intended to use the new Air Nation as leverage to get to Korra.

06:47.640 --> 06:51.440
Though when Tenzin figured that out, he promptly attacked them, giving the airbenders a chance

06:51.440 --> 06:52.600
