06:52.600 --> 06:56.560
While police focused on the escapees, managing to shoot Kai out of the sky, and corner

06:56.560 --> 07:01.040
the others at the flying bison stables, Zahir faced off against Tenzin, while Minghua took

07:01.040 --> 07:03.760
on Kaiya, leaving Ghazan to battle Bumi.

07:03.760 --> 07:07.360
Although Kaiya and Bumi each managed to get some hits in, they eventually had to acknowledge

07:07.360 --> 07:10.800
