08:18.320 --> 08:22.400
while Minghua used waterbending to make water dummies in airbender robes.

08:22.400 --> 08:26.960
When the deception was revealed, Gazan and Minghua left Mako, Bolin, Asami, and Tenzin

08:26.960 --> 08:30.160
