08:30.160 --> 08:35.080
Meanwhile, Korra, while chained with platinum cuffs, resisted Zahir as the metal clan engaged

08:35.080 --> 08:36.080
Pali.

08:36.080 --> 08:39.400
Taunrak assisted his daughter too, but was thrown from a cliff by Zahir.

08:39.400 --> 08:43.680
Lin subsequently acted as a distraction for Pali, as Suyin metal bends her chest plate

08:43.680 --> 08:47.760
around Portrait and Fire, confining the explosion to her head and killing her.

08:47.760 --> 08:52.080
However, the death of Pali allowed Zahir to unlock the unique airbending ability to fly

08:52.080 --> 08:56.840
by letting go of his earthly tether and escape the battle carrying Korra, who was unconscious.

08:56.840 --> 09:00.360
The red lotus took the Avatar to their mountain side hideout, where they planned to use

09:00.360 --> 09:05.040
Mercury to poison Korra and force her into the Avatar state, after which they would kill

09:05.040 --> 09:08.400
her and end the reincarnation cycle of the Avatar forever.

09:08.400 --> 09:12.280
But when Korra entered the Avatar state, she was able to break free of her chains and

09:12.280 --> 09:14.800
engage the here in an aerial battle.

09:14.800 --> 09:18.920
Meanwhile, team Avatar had discovered the hideout with the help of Kai, and freed the captured

09:18.920 --> 09:22.280
airbenders before engaging the remaining members of the red lotus.

09:22.280 --> 09:27.040
Mako and Bolin fought Minghua and Gazan respectively, and after a short battle, Mako managed

09:27.040 --> 09:31.200
