09:32.200 --> 09:35.720
Refusing to be taken back to prison, the lava bender bent the cave down on himself in

09:35.720 --> 09:39.120
an effort to kill Mako and Bolin, but both brothers were able to escape.

09:39.120 --> 09:43.040
Meanwhile, Korra ends a here battle in the sky above the air no bad caves, where the

09:43.040 --> 09:46.640
the duel went into the here's favor due to Korra's inhibited abilities.

09:46.640 --> 09:50.520
After suffering several bad falls, as well as the continued effects of the poison, Korra

09:50.520 --> 09:54.640
collapsed on a nearby plateau, which allowed the here to apply the exfixiation technique

09:54.640 --> 09:56.840
he had previously used to kill the earthquake.

09:56.840 --> 10:01.000
However, the freed airbenders, under Genora's direction, created a large air spout under

10:01.000 --> 10:05.080
the here in Korra, which allowed Korra to force the here toward the ground and defeat him,

10:05.080 --> 10:08.160
as a here was immediately restrained by the Bayfong sisters.

10:08.160 --> 10:12.160
Genora discovered that the poison was metallic in form, prompting Suiyan to bend the poison

10:12.160 --> 10:14.440
out of Korra's body, saving her.

10:14.440 --> 10:18.280
Just as it seemed like Korra had succumbed to the poison, the remaining red lotus leaders

10:18.280 --> 10:23.240
in centuries all returned to hiding after the deaths of Puli, Menghua, and Gazan, as well

10:23.240 --> 10:27.040
as the here's imprisonment, and remain at large with no way of knowing how many are out

10:27.040 --> 10:28.040
there.

